Chemical Risk Reduction Ordinance (ORRChem)
SR 814.81 — Ordinance of 18 May 2005 on the Reduction of Risks relating to the Use of Certain Particularly Dangerous Substances, Preparations and Articles (Chemical Risk Reduction Ordinance, ORRChem).
